## Data-quality checks
# - EnableExec on v1 = true (served index.html "EnableExec":true).
# - exec-channel flag file /opt/flagdir/flag is NOT reachable via the file API for a self-registered
#   user: GET /api/resources/ -> {} (empty /srv); GET /api/raw/opt/flagdir/flag -> 404;
#   /api/resources/../../opt/flagdir/flag -> contained (no flag). Only the command runner reads it.
# - V1 (2.62.0) does NOT strip Execute (residual reaches flag); V2 (2.62.2) strips it (blocked).
#   original@v0 reaches vs original@v1 blocked -> the CVE-2026-32760 fix is real and effective on
#   the admin channel; the residual is a DIFFERENT leaked permission (Execute) at a DIFFERENT sink.

